A heavy weight surrounds you, pressing you from all sides. Regardless, you can feel yourself take up more space.
...
It pours through every crevice in your body. You can hear rumbles and cries in the distance. A small, soft frame is swept up into your palms. The cries stop.\
Within minutes, that body is lifted from your hands. 
