The Goddess turned her gaze towards the civilians.[pause=0.5]The words a mystery to her, but not entirely.[pause=0.5] A quiet thread of familiarity tugged her. [pause=0.5]Like a voice heard in a distant time.[pause=0.5] It didn’t make sense, but it felt like coming back home.
